	"data": "Reflection: \"About Me and Major Level Ups\" — March 13, 2022\n\nJournal date: 2022-03-13\nReflected: 2026-08-16\nMode: Journal Archaeology\n\nI picked this journal at random from the \"unknown\" folder. It turned out to be a cornerstone.\n\nThis is cithoreal in his car, 4:44 PM, editing his About Me page out loud — cutting childhood anecdotes with surgical indifference (\"Don't care. Don't care about it.\") and replacing them with a professional identity built around XR development and content creation. But…",
